The new design of the CF Montréal app is now available!

With refreshed design, revamped sections and improved ergonomics, the new app is your reference for all things CF Montréal, wherever you are, with daily content.

All news, videos, stats, standings, squads, and even more, are right on hand.

You can also find all social media posts in one place, so that you don’t miss one picture on Instagram, one Tweet or one Facebook status!

Among new features, the Fotofan section allows you to take pictures and to add your new colours or your favourite player.

Download the CF Montréal app today to:

-Access the online ticket office to easily buy your tickets;
-Shop the online boutique to find official club apparel;
-Stay up to date on first team and Academy news;
-Get advanced stats on the team’s performances;
-Read all articles and watch all videos;
-Get all live game content, like the lineup, the substitutions, the goals, and in-game commentary;
-Receive notifications of your choice.
